{"seq":2,"slug":"variable-star-classes","title":"变星分类与测距","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/variable-star-classes","wordCount":2215,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"变星分类与测距\">变星分类与测距</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>脉动变星既是恒星物理的实验室，也是宇宙距离阶梯的基石，核心概念包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本征/外因之分</strong>：亮度变化源于恒星自身物理过程者为本征变星，源于外部几何效应者为外因变星</li>\n<li><strong>κ 机制与不稳定带</strong>：电离区不透明度随压缩升高驱动脉动，HR 图上近乎垂直的不稳定带决定哪些恒星会脉动</li>\n<li><strong>主要脉动类型</strong>：经典造父变星、天琴 RR 型变星、Mira 变星各自对应不同的质量、光度与演化阶段</li>\n<li><strong>周光关系（Leavitt 定律）</strong>：造父变星的周期-光度关系是测量河外距离的标准工具，构成宇宙距离阶梯的关键一阶</li>\n<li><strong>星震学</strong>：通过 p 模式与 g 模式振动频率探测恒星内部，大/小频率间距揭示密度与核心条件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"变星的定义与分类体系\">变星的定义与分类体系</h2><p>变星（Variable Star）是亮度随时间发生可测量变化的恒星。按照物理机制，变星可分为两大类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本征变星</strong>（Intrinsic Variables）：亮度变化源于恒星自身的物理过程（脉动、爆发、旋转不均匀性）</li>\n<li><strong>外因变星</strong>（Extrinsic Variables）：亮度变化源于外部几何效应（食双星、微透镜、行星凌星）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文聚焦于本征变星中的<strong>脉动变星</strong>——其物理机制最为清晰，天文应用最为重要。</p>\n<h2 id=\"脉动变星的物理基础\">脉动变星的物理基础</h2><h3 id=\"脉动驱动机制-机制\">脉动驱动机制：κ机制</h3><p>恒星脉动的主要驱动力来自<strong>κ机制</strong>（Opacity Mechanism）：</p>\n<p>在脉动压缩相，如果某层物质的不透明度随压缩<strong>增加</strong>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 升高而增大），则该层吸收更多辐射能量，将其转化为动能推动膨胀——类似热机中的正功。</p>\n<p>关键不透明度增高区（电离区）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>氢电离区</strong>（T ~ 10⁴ K）：驱动Mira变星和半规则变星</li>\n<li><strong>第一氦电离区</strong>（He I → He II, T ~ 4 × 10⁴ K）：参与多类脉动</li>\n<li><strong>第二氦电离区</strong>（He II → He III, T ~ 4–5 × 10⁴ K）：驱动造父变星和天琴RR型变星</li>\n<li><strong>铁族不透明度峰</strong>（T ~ 2 × 10⁵ K）：驱动β Cep和SPB型变星</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"不稳定带\">不稳定带</h3><p>HR图上存在一条近乎垂直的&quot;不稳定带&quot;——穿过该区域的恒星大多发生脉动：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>不稳定带位置</th>\n<th>有效温度范围</th>\n<th>主要变星类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经典不稳定带（蓝边）</td>\n<td>~7500 K</td>\n<td>δ Scuti</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经典不稳定带（中心）</td>\n<td>~6000 K</td>\n<td>造父变星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经典不稳定带（红边）</td>\n<td>~5000 K</td>\n<td>RR Lyrae</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红超巨星区域</td>\n<td>~3000 K</td>\n<td>Mira, 半规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>β Cep不稳定带</td>\n<td>~25000 K</td>\n<td>β Cep, SPB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[HR图不稳定带] --&gt; B[经典不稳定带&lt;br/&gt;He II电离驱动&lt;br/&gt;T~5000-7500K]&#10;    B --&gt; C[造父变星 I/II型&lt;br/&gt;超巨星穿越]&#10;    B --&gt; D[RR Lyrae&lt;br/&gt;水平支穿越]&#10;    B --&gt; E[δ Scuti&lt;br/&gt;主序/亚巨星穿越]&#10;    A --&gt; F[红变星区域&lt;br/&gt;H/He I电离驱动]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Mira变星&lt;br/&gt;AGB长周期]&#10;    F --&gt; H[半规则变星&lt;br/&gt;RGB/AGB]&#10;    A --&gt; I[热变星区域&lt;br/&gt;铁族不透明度]&#10;    I --&gt; J[β Cep&lt;br/&gt;早B型主序星]&#10;    I --&gt; K[SPB&lt;br/&gt;中B型主序星]\">graph TD\n    A[HR图不稳定带] --&gt; B[经典不稳定带&lt;br/&gt;He II电离驱动&lt;br/&gt;T~5000-7500K]\n    B --&gt; C[造父变星 I/II型&lt;br/&gt;超巨星穿越]\n    B --&gt; D[RR Lyrae&lt;br/&gt;水平支穿越]\n    B --&gt; E[δ Scuti&lt;br/&gt;主序/亚巨星穿越]\n    A --&gt; F[红变星区域&lt;br/&gt;H/He I电离驱动]\n    F --&gt; G[Mira变星&lt;br/&gt;AGB长周期]\n    F --&gt; H[半规则变星&lt;br/&gt;RGB/AGB]\n    A --&gt; I[热变星区域&lt;br/&gt;铁族不透明度]\n    I --&gt; J[β Cep&lt;br/&gt;早B型主序星]\n    I --&gt; K[SPB&lt;br/&gt;中B型主序星]</pre><h2 id=\"主要脉动变星类型\">主要脉动变星类型</h2><h3 id=\"经典造父变星-classical-cepheids-type-i\">经典造父变星（Classical Cepheids, Type I）</h3><p>造父变星是高光度的脉动超巨星，通过经典不稳定带时发生径向脉动。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光谱型</td>\n<td>F6–K2（脉动过程中变化）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>3–13 M☉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光度</td>\n<td>300–100000 L☉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉动周期</td>\n<td>1–100天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光变幅（V波段）</td>\n<td>0.5–2.0等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>径向速度变幅</td>\n<td>30–60 km/s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半径变化</td>\n<td>5–15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演化阶段</td>\n<td>蓝环穿越不稳定带（核心He燃烧）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>周光关系</strong>（Period-Luminosity Relation, Leavitt Law）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>V</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.43</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_V = -2.43 (\\log P - 1.0) - 4.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">2.43</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.05</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>或在近红外（更精确，红化影响小）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3.37</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1.0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5.66</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_K = -3.37 (\\log P - 1.0) - 5.66</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">3.37</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.66</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"天琴rr型变星-rr-lyrae\">天琴RR型变星（RR Lyrae）</h3><p>RR Lyrae 变星是低质量（~0.6–0.8 M☉）水平支恒星穿越不稳定带时的脉动产物：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光谱型</td>\n<td>A2–F6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对星等</td>\n<td>M_V ≈ +0.6 ± 0.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉动周期</td>\n<td>0.2–1.0天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光变幅</td>\n<td>0.3–1.5等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金属丰度</td>\n<td>[Fe/H] = −2.5 到 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存在环境</td>\n<td>球状星团、银晕、老年薄盘</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>亚类划分：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>亚类</th>\n<th>脉动模式</th>\n<th>周期范围</th>\n<th>光变曲线特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RRab</td>\n<td>基频径向模式</td>\n<td>0.4–1.0天</td>\n<td>快升慢降，锯齿形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RRc</td>\n<td>第一泛频</td>\n<td>0.2–0.4天</td>\n<td>近正弦形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RRd</td>\n<td>双模（基频+第一泛频）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>拍频调制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"mira-变星-长周期变星\">Mira 变星（长周期变星）</h3><p>Mira变星是AGB恒星的大幅度脉动变星：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>光谱型</td>\n<td>M型（有时S或C）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉动周期</td>\n<td>100–1000天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>光变幅（V波段）</td>\n<td>&gt; 2.5等（定义要求）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>1–4 M☉（主序前身）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>半径</td>\n<td>200–500 R☉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>演化阶段</td>\n<td>热脉冲AGB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"变星与宇宙距离阶梯\">变星与宇宙距离阶梯</h2><p>脉动变星在宇宙学距离测量中扮演核心角色，构成<strong>宇宙距离阶梯</strong>的关键阶梯：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[三角视差&lt;br/&gt;Gaia ≤数kpc] --&gt; B[造父变星周光关系&lt;br/&gt;校准]&#10;    B --&gt; C[造父变星&lt;br/&gt;本星系群~30Mpc]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Ia型超新星校准]&#10;    D --&gt; E[宇宙学距离&lt;br/&gt;z~1-2]&#10;    A --&gt; F[RR Lyrae&lt;br/&gt;球状星团/银晕&lt;br/&gt;~100kpc]&#10;    A --&gt; G[TRGB&lt;br/&gt;红巨星支顶端&lt;br/&gt;~20Mpc]&#10;    G --&gt; D\">graph LR\n    A[三角视差&lt;br/&gt;Gaia ≤数kpc] --&gt; B[造父变星周光关系&lt;br/&gt;校准]\n    B --&gt; C[造父变星&lt;br/&gt;本星系群~30Mpc]\n    C --&gt; D[Ia型超新星校准]\n    D --&gt; E[宇宙学距离&lt;br/&gt;z~1-2]\n    A --&gt; F[RR Lyrae&lt;br/&gt;球状星团/银晕&lt;br/&gt;~100kpc]\n    A --&gt; G[TRGB&lt;br/&gt;红巨星支顶端&lt;br/&gt;~20Mpc]\n    G --&gt; D</pre><h3 id=\"距离测量的系统误差来源\">距离测量的系统误差来源</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误差来源</th>\n<th>影响量级</th>\n<th>缓解方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>星际红化/消光</td>\n<td>0.1–0.3等</td>\n<td>近红外观测、Wesenheit指数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金属丰度效应</td>\n<td>0.05–0.2等</td>\n<td>多波段周光关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合效应（Blending）</td>\n<td>0.05–0.15等</td>\n<td>HST/JWST空间分辨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周光关系零点校准</td>\n<td>0.02–0.05等</td>\n<td>Gaia视差、VLBI</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非线性周光关系</td>\n<td>0.02–0.05等</td>\n<td>分段拟合、理论模型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"哈勃常数的张力\">哈勃常数的张力</h3><p>造父变星距离阶梯（SH0ES团队）给出 H₀ = 73.0 ± 1.0 km/s/Mpc，与CMB推导值 H₀ = 67.4 ± 0.5 km/s/Mpc 存在 ~5σ 的显著差异——这是现代宇宙学的核心悬而未决问题之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"星震学-恒星的-地震-研究\">星震学：恒星的&quot;地震&quot;研究</h2><p>星震学（Asteroseismology）通过分析恒星振动模式来探测其内部结构：</p>\n<h3 id=\"振动模式分类\">振动模式分类</h3><p>恒星的非径向振动用球谐函数描述，由三个量子数标记：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量子数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>模式类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>n（径向阶）</td>\n<td>径向节点数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>l（角阶）</td>\n<td>表面节线数</td>\n<td>l=0径向, l=1偶极, l=2四极</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>m（方位阶）</td>\n<td>经向节线数</td>\n<td>−l ≤ m ≤ l</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>振动模式的物理恢复力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>p模式</strong>（压力模式）：声波，频率较高，探测外层结构</li>\n<li><strong>g模式</strong>（重力模式）：浮力波，频率较低，探测核心区域</li>\n<li><strong>混合模式</strong>：在巨星中，p模式和g模式耦合</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"大间距与小间距\">大间距与小间距</h3><p>太阳型振荡的特征频率间距：</p>\n<p><strong>大频率间距</strong> Δν：相邻径向阶同阶模式的频率差 </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>≈</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>R</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>∝</mo><msqrt><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ρ</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta\\nu \\approx \\left(2\\int_0^R \\frac{dr}{c_s}\\right)^{-1} \\propto \\sqrt{\\bar{\\rho}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.204em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5912em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.954em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2195em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8205em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7805em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2195em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>小频率间距</strong> δν：相邻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 值模式的频率差，敏感于核心条件（年龄指标）</p>\n<h3 id=\"kepler-和-tess-的革命性贡献\">Kepler 和 TESS 的革命性贡献</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>时间</th>\n<th>贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kepler（2009–2018）</td>\n<td>连续4年测光</td>\n<td>数万颗太阳型振荡星、数百红巨星内部自转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TESS（2018–至今）</td>\n<td>全天巡天</td>\n<td>近邻明亮恒星的系统星震学参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PLATO（计划2026发射）</td>\n<td>长期高精度</td>\n<td>恒星年龄精确至10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"最新研究进展\">最新研究进展</h2><h3 id=\"jwst-对河外造父变星的精确测光-2024-2025\">JWST 对河外造父变星的精确测光（2024–2025）</h3><p>JWST的近红外高分辨率测光将造父变星观测推进到距离40 Mpc以外的星系，大幅减少了混合效应，为SH0ES距离阶梯提供独立验证。初步结果支持 H₀ ~ 73 km/s/Mpc的较高值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"gaia-dr3-视差校准\">Gaia DR3 视差校准</h3><p>Gaia DR3为约15000颗银河系造父变星提供了精确视差，使周光关系的零点校准达到前所未有的0.01–0.02等精度。然而，系统偏移的修正仍是活跃的研究课题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"红巨星星震学的新发现\">红巨星星震学的新发现</h3><p>TESS 全天数据结合地面光谱巡天，发现了大量处于&quot;红巨星颤动&quot;（red giant oscillation）状态的恒星，其混合模式频率间距揭示：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>约20%的红巨星核心自转速度是理论预期的10倍以上——暗示存在未知的角动量传输机制</li>\n<li>核心燃烧状态（RGB vs. clump）可通过g模式周期间距精确诊断</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>变星按物理机制分为本征变星（脉动、爆发、旋转不均匀）与外因变星（食双星、微透镜、凌星），本文聚焦物理机制最清晰的脉动变星。</li>\n<li>脉动由 κ 机制驱动（电离区不透明度随压缩升高），HR 图上由此形成近乎垂直的不稳定带；不同电离区对应不同变星类型——氢电离区驱动 Mira、第二氦电离区驱动造父变星与 RR Lyrae、铁族不透明度峰驱动 β Cep 与 SPB。</li>\n<li>经典造父变星的周光关系（Leavitt 定律）是宇宙距离阶梯的核心一阶：它上接三角视差、下接 Ia 型超新星，并给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>73.0</mn><mo>±</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_0=73.0\\pm1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">73.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> km/s/Mpc 与 CMB 值之间约 5σ 的张力。</li>\n<li>距离测量的系统误差（红化、金属丰度、混合效应、零点校准、非线性周光关系）是理解哈勃张力时必须量化的环节。</li>\n<li>星震学通过 p 模式（探测外层）与 g 模式（探测核心）的频率间距探测恒星内部，Kepler/TESS 的红巨星数据揭示的异常核心自转，正是这一方法的威力所在。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变星分类与测距","id":"变星分类与测距"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"变星的定义与分类体系","id":"变星的定义与分类体系"},{"level":2,"text":"脉动变星的物理基础","id":"脉动变星的物理基础"},{"level":3,"text":"脉动驱动机制：κ机制","id":"脉动驱动机制-机制"},{"level":3,"text":"不稳定带","id":"不稳定带"},{"level":2,"text":"主要脉动变星类型","id":"主要脉动变星类型"},{"level":3,"text":"经典造父变星（Classical Cepheids, Type I）","id":"经典造父变星-classical-cepheids-type-i"},{"level":3,"text":"天琴RR型变星（RR Lyrae）","id":"天琴rr型变星-rr-lyrae"},{"level":3,"text":"Mira 变星（长周期变星）","id":"mira-变星-长周期变星"},{"level":2,"text":"变星与宇宙距离阶梯","id":"变星与宇宙距离阶梯"},{"level":3,"text":"距离测量的系统误差来源","id":"距离测量的系统误差来源"},{"level":3,"text":"哈勃常数的张力","id":"哈勃常数的张力"},{"level":2,"text":"星震学：恒星的\"地震\"研究","id":"星震学-恒星的-地震-研究"},{"level":3,"text":"振动模式分类","id":"振动模式分类"},{"level":3,"text":"大间距与小间距","id":"大间距与小间距"},{"level":3,"text":"Kepler 和 TESS 的革命性贡献","id":"kepler-和-tess-的革命性贡献"},{"level":2,"text":"最新研究进展","id":"最新研究进展"},{"level":3,"text":"JWST 对河外造父变星的精确测光（2024–2025）","id":"jwst-对河外造父变星的精确测光-2024-2025"},{"level":3,"text":"Gaia DR3 视差校准","id":"gaia-dr3-视差校准"},{"level":3,"text":"红巨星星震学的新发现","id":"红巨星星震学的新发现"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"双星系统与质量转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/binary-star-systems"},"next":{"title":"新星与超新星物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/nova-supernova-physics"}}